---
description: Vibe Coding project rules — prototype freely in isolation, formalize before production
alwaysApply: true
---

MUST follow `AGENTS.md`, `docs/rules.md` and feature contracts in `docs/features/`. Prototype (`PROTOTYPE`/`DRAFT`) work stays isolated and labelled; production-bound work requires an `APPROVED` feature, tests first and human approval boundaries. MUST not invent project requirements or test results.
